# Helm bundles the ENTIRE chart directory into every release secret. This chart
# directory contained monitoring-1.0.0.tgz -- a 595 KB packaged copy of the chart
# itself -- which is 33% of the 1.78 MB directory and was therefore duplicated
# into all ~185 revisions.
#
# That matters beyond disk: the release secrets are stored in kine/sqlite, and a
# cluster-wide `LIST /secrets` is what velero issues on every cluster-wide
# backup. Fat release secrets are a direct contributor to the LIST timing out.
# Anchored with a leading slash so charts/*.tgz -- the real subchart
# dependencies -- are NOT excluded.
/monitoring-*.tgz

.git/
.gitignore
*.swp
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
.DS_Store
